130
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Legendary...?</font>

131
00:08:48,460 --> 00:08:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh dear! They're all laughing!</font>

132
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:00,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Legendary...
— Legendary...</font>

133
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sitting Duck!</font>

134
00:09:04,810 --> 00:09:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup! But no matter how famous
the Legendary Sitting Duck is,</font>

135
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I doubt we'll find her right away.</font>

136
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why not?!</font>

137
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She hates growing old so much</font>

138
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she's probably used some special Jutsu
to change her appearance.</font>

139
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's actually 50 years old,</font>

140
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but no doubt she looks like
she did when she was 20...</font>

141
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And not just that,
recently I heard that...</font>

142
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she transforms into her teens or
30s or 40s, whatever the situation calls for</font>

143
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to escape moneylenders.</font>

144
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! That's a horrible thing to do!</font>

145
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade has always loved
to gamble more than anything</font>

146
00:09:45,770 --> 00:09:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But she has terrible luck and no skill.</font>

147
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:53,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was always being played
for the Sitting Duck and the name stuck...</font>

148
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then she was always borrowing money
and skipping out on her debts, too...</font>

149
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, it brings back memories.</font>

150
00:10:00,910 --> 00:10:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no time to be
getting all nostalgic!</font>

151
00:10:03,490 --> 00:10:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me, how do you propose
we go about finding her?!</font>

152
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

153
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We may very well have to
put our noses to the ground,</font>

154
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:11,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we're not without our little tricks.</font>

155
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! So you have no idea
how long it's gong to take?!</font>

156
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't be wasting any time.</font>

157
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:24,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of our time on the road
will be your time.</font>

158
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:26,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My time?</font>

159
00:10:26,730 --> 00:10:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time to make you strong...
Training!</font>

160
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

161
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no... I told you that is definitely out.</font>

162
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be seen walking with someone
dressed like that.</font>

163
00:10:57,340 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, Pervy Sage!
Let's hurry up and start training!</font>

164
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now now, don't get ahead of yourself...</font>

165
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The training won't mean anything</font>

166
00:11:06,970 --> 00:11:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unless it's done in the process of
gathering information on Tsunade.</font>

167
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Gathering information...?</font>

168
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this town.</font>

169
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!</font>

170
00:11:32,170 --> 00:11:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cool! This is my first time
for this kind of thing!</font>

171
00:11:37,090 --> 00:11:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Down time is important, too!</font>

172
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go have yourself some fun
before we start training.</font>

173
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The festival should continue
for some time.</font>

174
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:45,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll stay here in this city
for the duration.</font>

175
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll train here, too!</font>

176
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

177
00:11:57,270 --> 00:12:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa! That's a fat wallet!
You're rich!</font>

178
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have quite a bit!</font>

179
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've saved it little by little
throughout my missions.</font>

180
00:12:07,370 --> 00:12:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then!</font>

181
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:10,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wait! Naruto!
— Huh?</font>

182
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll hold on to your wallet for you!</font>

183
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What do you think you're doing?!</font>

184
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can spend this much...</font>

185
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Only 300 ryo!</font>

186
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No complaints!</font>

187
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember Shinobi must honor
the " Shinobi's Three Taboos"!</font>

188
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi's Three Taboos...?
What's that?</font>

189
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You don't know!</font>

190
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The "three taboos" are
the three temptations</font>

191
00:12:33,850 --> 00:12:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that will bring Shinobi to ruin!</font>

192
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three temptations are
booze, women and money...</font>

193
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:45,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, then this doesn't really apply
to me all that much!</font>

194
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a minor, so I can't drink yet!
I don't quite get the women thing!</font>

195
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I worked so hard
to save all that money,</font>

196
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really feel much like using it...</font>

197
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:58,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool! Don't you underestimate
the desire for money!</font>

198
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once you start using it,
it goes really fast!</font>

199
00:13:02,010 --> 00:13:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money has a frightful power.</font>

200
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Tsunade we are going
to be looking for</font>

201
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:09,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has ruined herself over it!</font>

202
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:13,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your desire for women is always
getting the better of you, too, Pervy Sage!</font>

203
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going on
an information-gathering mission!</font>

204
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, you hold on to my bag for me!</font>

205
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get lost,</font>

206
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my tracking Summons Toad
will follow my scent!</font>

207
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:33,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's really just a child after all,
contrary to appearances...</font>

208
00:13:39,210 --> 00:13:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! First, I'll get a little something to eat!</font>

209
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take one order of
takoyaki, sir!</font>

210
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

211
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Potatoes with butter please!
— You got it!</font>

212
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I want chocolate bananas.
— Right!</font>

213
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I want apricot candy!
— Thank you!</font>

214
00:13:56,690 --> 00:14:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I want okonomiyaki too!
— Here you go! Watch out, it's hot!</font>

215
00:14:01,690 --> 00:14:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One extra-large order
of yakisoba, sir!</font>

216
00:14:04,610 --> 00:14:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... But my you've got
a lot of food there, young man!</font>

217
00:14:07,610 --> 00:14:10,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't plan
to eat it all yourself now, do you?!</font>

218
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh? As a matter of fact,
I am going to eat it all myself.</font>

219
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, um, here you go...</font>

220
00:14:20,210 --> 00:14:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I ate a bit too much.</font>

221
00:14:24,210 --> 00:14:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder how everyone is?</font>

222
00:14:27,970 --> 00:14:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei... Sasuke... Sakura-chan...</font>

223
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to train hard every day
and come back stronger.</font>

224
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just you wait and see!</font>

225
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But before that...
I better work off that meal!</font>

226
00:14:43,570 --> 00:14:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last one!</font>

227
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right! Perfect!
— Oh! Amazing!</font>

228
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:54,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the fruit of hard training
throwing shuriken.</font>

229
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You stink, sonny!</font>

230
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! God damn it!
Well, just watch this!</font>

231
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hold it!
— Huh?</font>

232
00:15:13,430 --> 00:15:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Attention: Shinobi!
Ninjutsu strictly forbidden!</b></font>

233
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks now!</font>

234
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't try to walk around
with the mask on.</font>

235
00:15:36,740 --> 00:15:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Pervy Sage's bank saving book.</font>

236
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, ten, one hundred...</font>

237
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Look at all those zeros!</font>

238
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should be treating me now and then
if he has this much money.</font>

239
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stingy old geezer!</font>

240
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's only a little left...
One more stand and that will be it...</font>

241
00:16:05,060 --> 00:16:08,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time to make you strong...
Training!</font>

242
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:20,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two grilled squids please, sir!
Make one of those an adult size!</font>

243
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Someone sent you
to buy some squid, eh?!</font>

244
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll throw in a child size for free!
Coming right up!</font>

245
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurray for you, sir!
You're a man among men!</font>

246
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you can tell, eh?! All right!
I'll give you the adult one for half price!</font>

247
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:34,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks!</font>

248
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief, where did he go to?!</font>

249
00:16:41,770 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? The voice of Pervy Sage?</font>

250
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Young ladies are so nice.</font>

251
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto! You've already had
your fill of the festival?</font>

252
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Repeat those three Shinobi Taboos again!</font>

253
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're breaking all three at once!
You bastard!</font>

254
00:17:12,050 --> 00:17:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait, Naruto...</font>

255
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No, I won't wait!</font>

256
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used all my hard-saved money!</font>

257
00:17:19,010 --> 00:17:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Take this and this and this!
— N-Naruto, stop!</font>

258
00:17:21,010 --> 00:17:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pay it all back!
I'm sorry, p-please!</font>

259
00:17:23,850 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! You!
You made my froggy wallet all flat!</font>

260
00:17:28,230 --> 00:17:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Look what you did, you urchin!</font>

261
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You stained Leader's designer suit!
You'll have to pay for it!</font>

262
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fork over 100,000 ryo!</font>

263
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You're telling me
that suit cost 100,000 ryo?!</font>

264
00:17:44,710 --> 00:17:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, really, that's quite a stretch</font>

265
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to say a dorky suit like that
cost 100,000 ryo.</font>

266
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you asking for it?!</font>

267
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better put a lid on it
if you know what's good for you.</font>

268
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The leader used be a Chunin from
the Hidden Village of Stones,</font>

269
00:17:57,470 --> 00:18:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the legendary dark Ninja, feared by all!</font>

270
00:18:01,810 --> 00:18:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come again? Legendary what?</font>

271
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You seem to want to get hurt!</font>

272
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:10,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

273
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perfect timing.</font>

274
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you a Jutsu now...
Watch very carefully!</font>

275
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you've done it!</font>

276
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Amazing!</font>

277
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was holding back quite a bit...
You guys are so weak.</font>

278
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:46,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Are you? The... legendary...</font>

279
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...
We kind of destroyed your stand...</font>

280
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Here... Fix it with this.</font>

281
00:18:53,570 --> 00:18:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Thanks.</font>

282
00:18:56,690 --> 00:19:00,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you mind if I bought all
your balloons and water balloons</font>

283
00:19:00,990 --> 00:19:02,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the same time, my man?</font>

284
00:19:02,570 --> 00:19:03,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine by me...</font>

285
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That wasn't an ordinary hand move...</font>

286
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell was that?!
That Jutsu!</font>

287
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

288
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me! It's training time!</font>

289
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

290
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally, the mood is right
for a little training.</font>

291
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Here! Water balloon!
— Wha...?</font>

292
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh?! What is it for?!</font>

293
00:19:36,230 --> 00:19:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saw that Jutsu I just used, right?</font>

294
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah.</font>

295
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Jutsu did it look like to you?</font>

296
00:19:44,490 --> 00:19:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looked like you made
your opponent spin violently.</font>

297
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His perspective's off...
But I guess that's to be expected.</font>

298
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, okay... Yes, spinning!</font>

299
00:19:55,340 --> 00:19:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's spinning the water in the balloon
without moving his hand?!</font>

300
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa!</font>

301
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tree-climbing exercise</font>

302
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to learn to gather and
maintain Chakra in necessary places...</font>

303
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Walk-on-Water exercise</font>

304
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to learn how to release
a set amount of Chakra...</font>

305
00:20:12,850 --> 00:20:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did both of these, right?</font>

306
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now with this water balloon exercise,</font>

307
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll learn how to create
a stream of Chakra...</font>

308
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, spinning.</font>

309
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Create a stream of Chakra...</font>

310
00:20:26,530 --> 00:20:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give a more detailed explanation
of the Jutsu</font>

311
00:20:28,910 --> 00:20:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">once you get these first steps down.</font>

312
00:20:32,210 --> 00:20:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, you must gather
and maintain Chakra in your hand</font>

313
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using the tree-climbing technique.</font>

314
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you must continuously
release Chakra</font>

315
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using the Walk-on-Water technique.</font>

316
00:20:40,710 --> 00:20:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you push and churn the water
in the balloon with the Chakra!</font>

317
00:20:46,510 --> 00:20:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it!</font>

318
00:20:48,310 --> 00:20:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you spin the water
in the balloon faster and faster</font>

319
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until the balloon pops!</font>

320
00:20:53,690 --> 00:20:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're catching on
more and more quickly!</font>

321
00:20:57,110 --> 00:20:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, today we're going
to train until evening!</font>

322
00:20:59,610 --> 00:21:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

323
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

324
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

325
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

326
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

327
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

328
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

329
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

330
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

331
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

332
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

333
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

334
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

335
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

336
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

337
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

338
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

339
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

340
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

341
00:21:57,430 --> 00:21:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

342
00:21:57,430 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

343
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

344
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

345
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

346
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

347
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

348
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

349
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

350
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

351
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

352
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

353
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

354
00:22:37,790 --> 00:22:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will break this water balloon
no matter what!</font>

355
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you're full of spirit!</font>

356
00:22:44,710 --> 00:22:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps I can expect him
to master the Jutsu.</font>

357
00:22:47,840 --> 00:22:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The water inside the balloon
is moving.</font>

358
00:22:51,970 --> 00:22:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, when does that pop?</font>

359
00:22:55,140 --> 00:22:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time:
"Keep on Training: Pop Goes the Water Balloon!"</font>

360
00:22:58,730 --> 00:23:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw Jeez! Why won't it pop?!</font>

